Package: markitdownshiny
Title: 'Shiny' Interface to Microsoft 'MarkItDown'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Paul E.",
           family = "Santos Andrade",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "paulefrens@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: Provides an interactive 'Shiny' application and 'R' functions for
    converting documents to Markdown format using Microsoft's Python 'markitdown'
    library. Supports converting Portable Document Format (PDF), Microsoft Word,
    PowerPoint, Excel, Comma-Separated Values (CSV), HyperText Markup Language
    (HTML), and images into clean Markdown text. Includes functions to launch
    the bundled 'Shiny' web application or execute document conversions
    programmatically.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
